export anchor SpaceStationHUDStyle:
    number: 301
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Space station HUD
    idea: A heads up display floating over near black, with hairline cyan rules, corner brackets instead of boxes, thin type with tiny telemetry labels, and a ring of twelve check ticks around the pull request number.
    base: dark
    palette:
        void: #03070b, the page and style sheet ground under a faint radial glow
        glass: #07121a, bracketed panels at 85 percent
        ink: #eaf7fb, text
        haze: #8fb4c2, telemetry labels and meta
        trace: #1f4250, hairline rules and dashed dividers
        hudCyan: #5be7ff, brackets, ring ticks, passed, approved, added lines, the primary button and focus
        amber: #ffcf5a, changes requested, the comment and Private
        fault: #ff7070, the failing check and removed lines
    type:
        A light grotesque, Helvetica Neue, Segoe UI, system-ui, at 200 for
        the title at 38px, the repository at 26px and readouts at 22 to
        26px, and at 300 for text at 15px and 1.5. Telemetry labels are
        SF Mono or a system monospace at 10.5px caps tracked 0.2em, the
        diff 12.5px monospace at 1.75.
    layout:
        A top line of three parts over a hairline, a ringed B mark with a
        dashed outer ring and the app name in spaced monospace, the
        repository centred in thin type with an amber Private tag, and
        Watch, Star and Fork as stacked label and number readouts split by
        hairlines. The tabs are centred spaced monospace caps, the current
        one cyan inside square brackets. Panels have no boxes, only four
        16px cyan corner brackets over dark glass. The body has three
        columns, 260px, flexible and 260px. The left holds Telemetry with
        11 / 12, the failing line and a numbered list of all twelve checks
        with ticks or a ringed cross at the right. The centre target panel
        has a ring gauge with twelve tick bars around 214 and a ringed red
        cross at seven o'clock, beside the Open label, the title, the
        merge sentence and a commit trace of six diamonds on a line. Below
        it the Feed panel shows the diff with 1px edge lines, and the
        comment is a bracketed amber Transmission. The right column holds
        Crew for reviewers, Payload with each file and a thin added and
        removed meter, and Docking with details and a dashed disabled
        merge. Below 1100px the centre leads, below 700px all stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between columns, 20px between panels, 18px inside brackets.
    density: Medium. Three columns of readouts around a centred target panel.
    corners: No boxes. Each panel is marked by four 16px corner brackets, with rings and diamonds as markers.
    borders: 1px hairlines only, cyan brackets, dashed trace dividers and square brackets around the current tab.
    shadows: None. A faint radial glow behind the top centre.
    icons:
        Thin 1.3px line icons. A tick for passed, an octagon cross for
        failing, a ringed tick for approved, a triangle for changes. The
        ring uses bars for passed and a ringed cross for failing.
    focus: A 1px cyan outline offset 4px with an outer 1px cyan ring and a faint halo.
    tone: Station telemetry, such as Telemetry, Payload, Feed, Transmission, T+6 commits and Docking clamps hold.
